    "text": "The value <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>9</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced><mi>dx</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>, is _____.",
